  "description": "Bundled .wit scripts for the OutWit.Controller.Render controller — RenderFrames, RenderStill, RenderSceneFrames, RenderPreflight, and the 30+ other render orchestration scripts that WitCloud's ScriptSeeder reads from @Scripts/ on startup. Frame-distribution scripts use the persistent-batch path (Render.SplitBatched + Render.FrameBatch, one Blender process per contiguous frame chunk); tiled stills render per-tile (Render.SplitTiles + Render.Frame). Adds the full BakeAndRender family — {Still,Frames,Video}{Cycles,Eevee,GreasePencil} plus StillTiled{Cycles,Eevee,GreasePencil} — which bake an unbaked simulation (Mantaflow fluid/smoke, point-cache cloth/particles/etc, or Geometry-Nodes sim) on the best node via Grid.Delegate + Render.BakeSimulation before distributing the render in the scene's native engine.",
  "iconFile": "WitEngine-logo.png",
